 301:Generated_Source\PSoC4/cyfitter_cfg.c **** *  This function is called by the start-up code for the selected device. It
 302:Generated_Source\PSoC4/cyfitter_cfg.c **** *  performs all of the necessary device configuration based on the design
 303:Generated_Source\PSoC4/cyfitter_cfg.c **** *  settings.  This includes settings from the Design Wide Resources (DWR) such
